              "version": "pinned 2026-10-13",
              "date": "2026-10-30",
              "note": "The pinned /DomainInfo/domains_data responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/result/properties/data oneOf references HashOutput and ListOutput. ListOutput omits the array container, whereas parameter format=list and examples/list/value/data explicitly contain a list. HashOutput main_domain describes items while examples/hash/value/data/addon_domains/2/main_domain is an object. The effective contract retains both documented containers and the explicit example object. Components Contents and MainDomainContents supply optional row fields; list examples additionally supply options, numeric-string port, string flags, customlog/scriptalias lists, and separate parked redirect name lists. Parked domain names also occur as strings in the hash example. These are pinned documentation discrepancies, not live observations."
            }
          ]
        }
