      "notes": [
        {
          "kind": "documented",
          "text": "Returns a hash of domain-type containers or a list according to format. User-data files can omit any documented field. Explicit null IPv6 remains null. Pinned prose/schema and examples disagree on several containers; the effective shape preserves the documented hash/list variants and example log/alias lists."
        },
